{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i>Cats in Cozy Rooms</i>!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/ezgif.com-crop_cat3.gif?t=1744705035\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A relaxing, hand-drawn room decorating game where you design beautiful spaces for picky but adorable feline clients!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/GameDescriptionIMG4.png?t=1744705035\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every Cat Has Its Own Style!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level introduces a new cat with unique likes and dislikes. Some prefer a <strong>rustic</strong> aesthetic, while others love a <strong>more minimalistic</strong> style. Be careful\u2014your client may adore <strong>cozy sofa </strong>but despise <strong>loud music</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/GameDescriptionIMG3.png?t=1744705035\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-Drawn Art &amp; Cozy Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a relaxing experience with beautifully crafted, hand-drawn assets. Every object, cat, and decoration is uniquely illustrated to create a warm and charming world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/Gif_Play_Opt.gif?t=1744705035\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Game Made for Creativity &amp; Relaxation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you want to carefully plan every detail or just have fun designing cute spaces, <i>Cats in Cozy Rooms</i> lets you express your creativity at your own pace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/GameDescriptionIMG2.png?t=1744705035\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3432590?t=1744705035","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/65417d714238348b8858fe90a73b5e28a9a614b3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744705035","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/8643dc878b7fedfe6f6f35617a14dafbe4bab532/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744705035","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/8643dc878b7fedfe6f6f35617a14dafbe4bab532/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744705035","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3499480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i>Cats in Cozy Rooms</i>!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/ezgif.com-crop_cat3.gif?t=1744705035\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A relaxing, hand-drawn room decorating game where you design beautiful spaces for picky but adorable feline clients!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432590/extras/GameDescriptionIMG4.png?t=1744705035\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every Cat Has Its Own Style!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level introduces a new cat with unique likes and dislikes. Some prefer a <strong>ru